      <h4 class="section-label-x2">
        02 / SANDIA.GOV REDESIGN &bull; 2025 - 2026
      </h4>

      <p>
        By 2025, Sandia's public-facing website required a comprehensive
        modernization. Following a 2023 migration from Cascade Server CMS to
        WordPress, fragmented styling and broken layouts had compromised the
        user experience.
      </p>

      <p>
        The objective was to restore visual consistency, align the platform with
        modern web and usability standards, and build a streamlined system for
        content creators.
      </p>
    </article>

    <div class="case-details-grid">
      <article class="case-details-card">
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>UX Strategy & Leadership</h3>
        <p>
          Translated user research insights into comprehensive wireframes and
          user flows. Led the creative direction to establish a cohesive visual
          identity aligned with corporate design standards.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="case-details-card">
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Prototyping & Development</h3>
        <p>
          Designed graphics and built high-fidelity interactive prototypes in
          Axure RP. Wrote clean JavaScript interactions and foundational CSS to
          accelerate engineering handoffs.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

