    <article class="case--content-block block-margin">
      <h4 class="section-label-x2">
        03 / SANDIA.GOV REDESIGN &bull; 2019
      </h4>

      <p>
        As the Lead UX/UI Designer and Front-End Developer, I headed a core
        team—including a backend developer and a business analyst—to overhaul
        Sandia's external web presence, which had not been updated since 2010.
        While maintaining the existing information architecture, we partnered
        with the Communications department to deliver a modernized aesthetic and
        establish a new, Labs-wide UI library for all internal and external web
        platforms.
      </p>
      <p>The sandia.gov 2019 comprehensive redesign was honored nationally, where it won Gold and Best-In-Show awards at the Public Relations Society of America's annual awards. By pairing rigorous user research with a cutting-edge front-end framework, the redesign not only elevated Sandia's digital brand value but also established a gold standard for public-sector usability and design excellence.</p>
    </article>

