    <article class="case--content-block block-margin">
      <h4 class="section-label-x2">
        04 / INTERNAL WEBSITES & RESTRICTED SYSTEMS &bull; 2015 - 2023
      </h4>

      <p>
        Parallel to public-facing initiatives, I led and took end-to-end
        ownership of dozens of internal web projects within Sandia's restricted
        networks. These applications ranged from small tactical tools to
        large-scale enterprise systems. On each project, stakeholder teams
        sought out my expertise to deconstruct complex technical workflows and
        architect modern, durable, and user-centric usability frameworks.
      </p>
      <p>I engineered highly customized WordPress solutions tailored for secure, high-performance web deployment. Moving beyond stock configurations, I developed bespoke themes and modular page-builder components from scratch, ensuring perfect alignment with strict corporate design guidelines and usability paradigms.</p>
      <p>Every custom deployment focused heavily on rapid asset compiling, clean semantic layout structures, and rigorous front-end optimization to support frictionless editorial workflows for content teams.</p>
    </article>

